WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
You asked for a button fix. It rewrote the page.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
You keep saying: ask before expanding scope.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
PD turns related corrections into a proposed principle.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
You review, edit, and decide whether to adopt it.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.200
In a similar task, the principle guides behavior.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.000
Check what actually changes.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.200
Fewer repeated corrections.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.000
You stay in control — withdraw anytime.

